    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What I changed vs. the n8n community template\n1. One `Config` node (prompts, API vars, limits, chat id, sheet id) instead of two Set nodes.\n2. Retries on all external HTTP calls (FAL queue submit: 2 tries to avoid duplicate paid jobs).\n3. `Poll Guard`: the original status loop could run forever; now it stops on FAILED or after N checks.\n4. `Video Quality Check`: file exists, is video/*, size within limits.\n5. `Log Run` to Google Sheets, Telegram notification, Error Trigger -> Telegram + sheet.\n\nSetup: credentials (FAL header auth, Upload-Post, Telegram, Google Sheets), Config + Error Config values, Settings -> Error Workflow = this workflow.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
